{%- comment -%}
  Local-only test wrapper for the announcement-bar-ticker snippet (jrva2hec).
  Mirrors what Studio's "section: header, position: above" install would
  produce: a snippet rendered from inside sections/header.liquid, so the
  bar lives inside the same .shopify-section.header-section wrapper as
  <header-component> and inherits the theme's sticky-header behavior.

  Hardcodes 14 slides covering every snippet variation:
    asset types  : image, gif, mp4, webm
    positions    : leading, trailing, background
    redirects    : relative, absolute https, mailto, tel, blocked scheme, none
    edge cases   : text-only slide, rich HTML title with em + strong + long copy

  Class names + data attributes mirror the library snippet's SSR output so
  the existing aggregate CSS + sai-snippet-jrva2hec.js pick this up without
  any further changes.
{%- endcomment -%}

